Summary
Project discussions streamlined listing intake forms and prioritized front-end development over dashboard implementation for operational launch.

Streamlining Listing Intake Forms
Developers identified redundant fields and complex logic to simplify the user interface. The primary decision was to default all listing agreement terms to exclusive right to sell.

Optimizing User Experience Workflow
The team refined the onboarding sequence to guide sellers from account creation through Multiple Listing Service input. Administrative access to documents was improved to facilitate better information management.

Prioritizing Front End Readiness
Stakeholders focused efforts on onboarding and homepage functionality to initiate site traffic. This strategy delays complex dashboard feature development until initial listing operations are established.

