Parcel and tax information fields hidden Tax parcel number and 'no assigned parcel number' fields are hidden from the user interface.
Lot and frontage fields hidden Lot size, frontage, side, and back measurement fields are hidden from the user interface.
MLS intake form field configurations The MLS intake form will be configured to retain water and wire shares, while hiding lot size, estimated taxes, APN, and irregular shape inputs.
Basement and property level conditional logic Conditional logic will be implemented for property level inputs to ask if a basement exists, determining whether basement-specific fields are displayed.
Listing intake form column layout The listing intake form layout will be reformatted to use columns to improve visibility and usability for long questions.
Pool and HOA field labeling The community pool field will be retained and the prompt updated to specify that it includes HOA-managed pools.
Form field requirement and default settings Form field requirements will be updated to make utilities required, while making non-essential fields optional and defaulting financial terms to cash or conventional.
Showing instructions section default settings The showing instructions section will be hidden and defaulted to a standard call showing service option.
Title company field logic The title company field logic will be updated to allow users to specify an alternative title company if they do not choose the default.
Remarks section tooltips and labels Tooltips and clarifying labels will be added to the remarks section to distinguish between public remarks, exclusion remarks, and comments to Glide.
Photo upload interface previews The photo upload interface will be updated to display uploaded image previews rather than icons.
Admin intake data export format The admin intake view and print export format will be converted from JSON to readable plain text.
Landing page UI simplification The landing page UI will be simplified to remove the buy-a-home option and feature a prominent sell-your-home call to action.
Website layout and menu organization The website front-end is updated to prioritize a specific call to action, reorganize menu items, and include the Kelly Wright logo.
Development prioritization strategy The development of the dashboard is deprioritized in favor of finalizing the front-end and onboarding processes.

